From: Amperstrand <Amperstrand@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Consolidated fork delta vs upstream crates.io mfrc522 0.8.0

Submission-grade consolidated diff of Amperstrand/mfrc522-rs fork head
(5e4929b, 2026-10-20 upstreamability-cleanup head) against the upstream
crates.io mfrc522 0.8.0 source tarball (2024-11-24; manifest from
Cargo.toml.orig). Re-derived 2026-10-20 by unpacking the tarball and
diffing trees; junk-free by construction at this head (the 2026-10-19
derivation had to hand-exclude the stray src/comm/comm/ duplicate and
tracked Cargo.lock, both since removed from the fork).

